<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We are pleased to inform you that your application titled “<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>” (Application ID: {!IndividualApplication.Name}) has been <b>shortlisted for presentation</b> before the Selection Committee.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">This recognition reflects the merit and potential impact of your proposal. You will soon receive further details regarding the presentation round.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We encourage you to prepare for the presentation accordingly and look forward to your participation in the next stage of the selection process.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Congratulations on this achievement, and we wish you all the best.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>